              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uko ni kw igikorwa cose Salomo yakoreye ingoro y’Uhoraho carangiye. Maze yinjiza ivyo se Dawidi yari yaragize inyegu y’ Uhoraho, amafeza n’amazahabu, n’ibintu vy’ibikoreshwa, abishira mu bubīko bg’ingoro y’Imana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.1",
